        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Heat, at solar+gas heating, tube collector, one-family house, combined system
Use of a solar system including the necessary auxiliary heating.;
UUID: 5475c737-62b6-3b0d-8bba-99f0ce7f727d
Delivery of heat with a solar system including the necessary auxiliary heating, maintenance and electricity use for operation.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Operation of a solar collector system in combination with a gas heating.
Time period: Time of simulation.
Production volume: Total solar heat delivered by evacuated tube collectors in 2001 was 2.3TJ.
Sampling: Simulation done by SPF Rapperswil with Polysun 3.3 computer programme. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5475c737-62b6-3b0d-8bba-99f0ce7f727d.xml</text>
